WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions

AD001
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.960
White text on black background.

AD002
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:17.260
Multiple large rocket engines ignite, emitting bright, glowing plumes of light and exhaust downwards.

AD003
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.370
A bright white beam rises from the industrial city.

AD004
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.190
A caption: Forty years later.

AD005
00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:58.880
A caption: Simulation ready. Two people sit at a workbench facing a large screen.

AD006
00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:04.050
A caption: Tears of Steel.

AD007
00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.090
Smoke rises from a foggy, industrial city skyline.

AD008
00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.020
The room remains still and unchanged.

AD009
00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.020
A headline: Roboticist creates killer robots.

AD010
00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.270
The sniper aims his rifle.

AD011
00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:27.660
A mechanical vehicle with turrets sits in the fog.

AD012
00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:37.200
An airship hovers over the city.

AD013
00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:41.100
The old man lies motionless on the balcony floor.

AD014
00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:46.630
The sniper aims his futuristic rifle through the scope at the hovering airship.

AD015
00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:03.570
The old man sits up and gestures while the sniper aims his rifle in the background.

AD016
00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.150
The old man crouches, looking down.

AD017
00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:21.100
The sniper aims his rifle through the scope, looking intently.

AD018
00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:24.920
The old man grips a thick rope.

AD019
00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:29.790
The sniper drinks from a mango juice pouch, then lowers it to look forward.

AD020
00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:37.120
A figure in a dark coat hangs suspended in mid-air before the organ pipes.

AD021
00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:42.630
The old man touches his chest, then walks away toward a tunnel.

AD022
00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:57.280
The old man and Celia stand facing each other, staring intently in the dimly lit room.

AD023
00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:08.620
The old man stands on a cobblestone street, facing a massive mechanical structure in the fog.

AD024
00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:16.220
The man raises a gun.

AD025
00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:29.270
Clock ticks.

AD026
00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:41.140
A person in a reddish-brown jacket raises both arms toward a massive, glowing geometric light structure.

AD027
00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.330
A man with a mechanical eye points and sticks out his tongue.

AD028
00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:11.130
A heavyset man leans in to whisper to the old man.

AD029
00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.640
Celia and two men watch green holograms.

AD030
00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:22.760
Thom walks across a bridge with green railings, looking around with a serious expression.

AD031
00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:49.270
A heavyset man sits at a desk, a device attached to his head.

AD032
00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:08.730
A man in a futuristic suit glows with white energy.

AD034
00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:24.340
Thom looks off-camera.

AD035
00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:32.980
A giant mechanical robot rises from the street, towering over historic buildings.

AD036
00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.770
A caption: Celia, I love your robot hand.

AD037
00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.810
A robotic hand covers Thom’s face.

AD038
00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:15.960
A caption: Playback.

AD039
00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:34.810
Thom presses a rifle to his face.

AD040
00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.620
A curly-haired man stares in shock.

AD041
00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.160
The old man looks up with concern.

AD042
00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.320
A caption: Cool, I love your new hand.

AD043
00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:49.410
Thom mouths a word.

AD044
00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:53.050
Celia stares at her robotic hand.

AD045
00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.360
A wireframe hologram touches Thom’s face.

AD046
00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.650
A caption: 80:0

AD047
00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:06.190
A man with a mechanical eye holds a device to his mouth.

AD048
00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:14.610
The sniper aims a smoking rifle at a distant structure.

AD049
00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.770
White smoke vents from a circular metal component.

AD050
00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:30.160
A man in a white jacket holds a cylindrical mechanical device, looking at it with concern.

AD051
00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.460
Two large grey robots face each other in the dust.

AD052
00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:54.050
Four people in white suits kneel on the floor, aiming futuristic firearms at a large mechanical structure.

AD053
00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:01.500
Dark, cluttered industrial space rushes by.

AD054
00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:04.600
The sniper rests his head against his rifle.

AD055
00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.760
Golden light reflects off the dark corridor.

AD056
00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:13.620
A masked figure raises a weapon as a mechanical creature crashes through the organ pipes.

AD057
00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:22.210
An explosion erupts in the cathedral, sending fire and debris toward the organ pipes.

AD058
00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:32.740
Thom stands on a bridge, staring at a large mechanical structure beside him.

AD059
00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:45.980
Thom speaks seriously near a stone sculpture, then a large robot stands in a ruined interior.

AD060
00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.160
Steam rises from a complex mechanical structure.

AD061
00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.730
The old man smiles faintly.

AD062
00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:03.090
A caption: Memory overwrite ninety-nine point seven eight percent.

AD063
00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:08.940
The old man presses his hand against a glowing purple component of the large machine.

AD064
00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:16.300
The old man stares intently at a large metallic object.

AD065
00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:24.970
Celia gestures.

AD066
00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:32.150
Celia gestures at the large mechanical structure beside her on the metal platform.

AD067
00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.870
A cast list appears over a close-up of a blue-outlined robotic hand.

AD068
00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.050
Blender development and studio pipeline

AD069
00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:23.270
Credits: JustaCluster, Dell Lab Amsterdam

AD070
00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:55.060
The sniper sits atop a pile of rusted robot wreckage, holding a rifle and a small white cup.

AD071
00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:10.990
The screen fades to black.
